    M0: complete TASK-260715-1vv52g unmodified HEV/lwIP <-> bridge integration (accepted)
    
    Real pinned HEV/lwIP XCFramework wired to PacketFlowBridge via ReluxTunnelNative
    Adapter: scoped endpoint-B borrow on a dedicated pthread (no ownership transfer,
    no double close), ADR-020 config (udp-copy-buffer-nums=2 keeps task stack 24576,
    all values injectable, fail-closed against silent upstream clamp), loopback-only
    authenticated internal SOCKS rejecting external ingress, notices traced to the
    pinned manifest, HEV unmodified. Stop-the-line (silent stack clamp) resolved via
    ADR-020. Rework-01 fixed a reviewer-found reachable shutdown deadlock (quit-after-
    main-return guard) + a SOCKS listener fd-reuse window. 49 tests + HEV TSan.
    Producer codex-sol; reviewer claude-fable (2 rounds, traced upstream source).
    Packet plane closed: PacketFlow -> bridge -> HEV/lwIP -> internal SOCKS.

